	(text "The original 5V-only dumper is preserved in baseline_readonly/. This project adds programming-voltage routing.\nNo onboard VPP boost. Exact manufacturer profiles govern voltages, pin roles and algorithm.\nHardware bring-up and pulse-waveform validation are required before commissioning WRITE. One target at a time."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
